    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "A computer program runs for 7568 seconds. Convert this to hours, minutes and seconds.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "2 hours, 6 minutes and 8 seconds",
      "worked": "There are 60 seconds in a minute and 60 minutes in an hour.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}7568\\div60&=126\\text{ remainder }8\\\\126\\div60&=2\\text{ remainder }6\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe first remainder is 8 seconds; the second is 6 minutes. The program runs for **2 hours, 6 minutes and 8 seconds**.",
